title: Main
---
<<declare $card1 = "">>
<<declare $card2 = "">>
<<declare $card3 = "">>
<<setAdventureImage "">>
<<enemyTitle MpYatsuhashi>>
<<lEnemyName MpYatsuhashi>>
Hey, you guys are also looking for the branch! Right? #line:mpperf_001
<<enemyTitle MpBenben>>
<<lEnemyName MpBenben>>
I see you're working together for once, but your coordination is a bit sloppy. #line:mpperf_002
-> [Accept help] Choose 1 of 3 multiplayer cards to add to the deck. <<if $card1 != "">> #line:mpperf_optaccept
    <<if $card3 != "">>
        <<selectCards {$card1} {$card2} {$card3}>>
    <<elseif $card2 != "">>
        <<selectCards {$card1} {$card2}>>
    <<else>>
        <<selectCards {$card1}>>
    <<endif>>
    {getPlayerName()} feels more coordinated. #line:mpperf_003
-> [Refuse] Leave. #line:mpperf_optrefuse
    <<if getPlayerId() == "Cirno">>
        <<lPlayerName>>
        I'm already carrying the team, thank you very much! #line:mpperf_004
    <<endif>>
<<stop>>
===
